= Knowledge domains =

== Scope ==
This category contains BITwiki's currently accepted broad subject Domains: durable fields used to answer '''what body of knowledge does this object belong to?'''

Domains are semantic/browse contexts, not exclusive containers. A knowledge object may belong to more than one Domain when the subject genuinely spans fields.

